    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "One GRPO update, from data to loss. An untrained policy plays 8 episodes of a 4x4 grid world (goal +1, trap -1); with the run seed this graph stores, 3 episodes reach the goal and 5 fall into the trap. GroupRelativeAdvantage scores each episode against the group: an episode that did better than the group mean gets a positive advantage, worse gets a negative one, and no value network is needed. The advantage is copied to every step of its episode and fed to the PPO clipped objective.\n\n一次 GRPO 更新，從資料到 loss。還沒訓練的策略在 4x4 的格子世界裡玩 8 回合（終點 +1、陷阱 -1）；在這張圖存的 run seed 下，有 3 回合走到終點、5 回合掉進陷阱。GroupRelativeAdvantage 拿每一回合和整組比較：比組平均好的回合得到正的 advantage，比較差的得到負的，完全不需要 value 網路。advantage 會複製到該回合的每一步，再送進 PPO 的 clipped objective。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ppo",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 730
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Old and new log-probs are the same tensor here, so every ratio is 1 and nothing is clipped: this is the first step of an update, before the policy has moved. In a training loop the new log-probs come from the updated policy and the clip keeps the ratio within 1 +/- epsilon.\n\n這裡新舊 log-prob 接的是同一個張量，所以每個 ratio 都是 1，也不會被裁切：這是一次更新的第一步，策略還沒變動。在訓練迴圈裡，新的 log-prob 來自更新後的策略，clip 會把 ratio 限制在 1 +/- epsilon 之內。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "ppo",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 530
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
